      "text": "The early HAVING check reports `HAVING clause on a non-aggregate query` for `SELECT missing FROM t HAVING 1`, but SQLite reports `no such column: missing` because it resolves result columns first. Fix: move this check after result-column resolution and before WHERE resolution, and add a regression case."
